OL,3,AEthiopian PM puts ministers through
OL,4,Amilitary training
OL,5,
OL,6,FEthiopian Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed has
OL,7,Fput his cabinet ministers and other
OL,8,Fsenior government officials through
OL,9,Fmilitary training, saying armed forces
OL,10,Fdiscipline can help build stronger
OL,11,Fleaders and advance the country's
OL,12,Fdevelopment.
OL,14,FPhotos shared by him on social media
OL,15,Fshow him taking part in military
OL,16,Fexercises alongside ministers, deputy
OL,17,Fministers and heads of government
OL,18,Finstitutions at the Hurso military
OL,19,Ftraining centre.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
