OL,3,AEthiopian PM puts ministers through
OL,4,Amilitary training
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move is unusual in Ethiopia, where
OL,7,Fsenior civilian government officials
OL,8,Fare rarely seen undergoing military
OL,9,Ftraining.
OL,11,FThose taking part include Speaker of
OL,12,Fthe House of Federation Muferiat Kamil,
OL,13,FFinance Minister Fitsum Assefa and
OL,14,FHealth Minister Mekdes Daba.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
